      "translation": {
        "english_text": "There, you can see it! That is... the hoarding warehouse of that daylight masquerader!... Inside are hundreds of thousands' worth of what belongs to you!... Come; I will take out and give you the food grain you need!...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
