      "translation": {
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [],
        "english_text": "(There, amid another crowd, stand the zamindar and Kalingan, distributing rice, wheat and other grains by the armful. Vingan stops in astonishment at the sight...)"
      }
    },
