      "translation": {
        "english_text": "(looking sharply at the zamindar) Don't tell them outside which birthday it is!.. The whole year is your birthday—give generously to everyone—eat well, bless him and go! Come, everyone... take everything... come... take whatever is being given and praise our master as the great benefactor Pari before you go! Why are you standing there? Come...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
