      "translation": {
        "english_text": "What, son-in-law!... Have you ever at least read a story in which a goat played in front of a tiger?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "`வேங்கை` is a tiger and `வெள்ளாடு` a goat; the source uses the predator/prey image as a warning."
